# Local-only architecture/design notes. These contain third-party comparison
# material that must never reach this public repository. Keep them on disk,
# out of git.
#
# docs/adr/ is deliberately NOT in this list: decision records are a durable
# repo artifact and docs/agents/domain.md points readers at them. An ADR may
# cite the reference solutions only as Project K and Project B, described by
# layer and abstraction - never a real name, namespace, vendor or ticket key.
